4. Compare files_changed against the no-touch set at the point in run_coder where the diff is already computed, immediately after the existing files_changed assignment at line 1129 and before the succeeded determination at line 1132. This is the measurement that already exists; this step only adds the comparison that was missing. Return the existing failure value rather than a new one so the caller already handles it:

