5. Prove the runtime matcher and the design-time parser agree on the same shipped frame, so the two tools cannot drift apart:

```sh
cd /home/kcat/Repos/llm-driven-design
python3 - <<'PY'
import sys
sys.path.insert(0, ".LLMDD/tools")
from cu_scope import parse_no_touch, is_touched
base = ".LLMDD/ITRS/bugfix-feature-5-enforce-advisor-read-only-approval"
