assert is_touched(parsed.patterns, ".opencode/agents/llmdd/advisor.md")
assert not is_touched(parsed.patterns, "README.md")
print("RUNNER_PARSER_AGREE")
PY
```

Prove: `RUNNER_PARSER_AGREE` is printed and the exit status is 0.

